ss=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Warzone%202\">Warzone 2</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFrequently attacks low level mages.<br/><br/>A weeper attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tIf hunting with mages, protect them. They will retarget almost every turn to the lowest level mage, even if they are unreachable (e.g. if a mage is on the other side of the warzone bars, the knight/paladin inside will not be attacked). Energy walls are useful to protect yourself from them.\nHis beam is similar to <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellfire%20Fighter\">Hellfire Fighter</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on April 23, 2024, the patch increased its experience from 4,800 to 5,200, made it no longer retreat at low health, and reduced strength of speed debuff as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li>\n<li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch increased experience from 5,200 to 5,800 as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot<